    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yurei Hunt</strong> \u2013 A Supernatural Prop Hunt Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yurei Hunt is a multiplayer prop hunt game set in a world of haunted, mystical locations. Play as a Yurei, a ghost that can possess almost any object to hide, trick, and escape, or as a Hunter, searching for spirits disguised in plain sight. Each map is filled with interactive elements that both sides can use to outsmart each other, making every round a thrilling mix of strategy, deception, and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in the haunting atmosphere of <i>Yurei Hunt</i> with real-time proximity voice chat!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your teammates and strategize, but beware\u2014your voice travels just like in real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you are to someone, the clearer they hear you. As you move away, your voice fades into the eerie silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghosts can whisper... or taunt!</strong> Hunters and ghosts alike can use voice chat, making every round an intense mind game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension rise as you hear distant whispers in the dark\u2014was that your teammate... or something else?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay silent, stay hidden... or risk being heard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments &amp; Evolving Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse maps inspired by eerie <strong>traditional Japanese locations</strong> and <strong>futuristic cyberpunk cityscapes</strong>. From <strong>cursed shrines</strong> cloaked in mist to <strong>neon-lit streets</strong> pulsing with energy, every setting offers <strong>unique ways to outmaneuver</strong> your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0f <strong>Diverse Maps</strong> \u2013 Haunted shrines, dense forests, cyberpunk streets, and more, each designed for mind games and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Tactical Abilities &amp; Deception</strong> \u2013 As a Yurei you can turn into almost any object in the map and you can manipulate your surroundings, creating illusions and using darkness to evade capture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/9d8131e67e19cfd601f929a487a7dba6.poster.avif?t=1752500112\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/9d8131e67e19cfd601f929a487a7dba6.webm?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/9d8131e67e19cfd601f929a487a7dba6.mp4?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiplayer\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Play with up to <strong>8 players</strong>, competing with friends or online opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Thick fog, sudden snow, or lightning strikes can change visibility and create new strategies for both Yurei and Hunters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/0cbe4f766bd075559498136024e79d79.poster.avif?t=1752500112\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/0cbe4f766bd075559498136024e79d79.webm?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/0cbe4f766bd075559498136024e79d79.mp4?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World Elements:</strong> Each map features unique interactive elements that shape the game. Turn off streetlights with switches to cloak Yurei in darkness, or extinguish lanterns in shrines for a stealthy escape. From flickering neon signs to creaky doors, every environment offers new ways to hide, hunt, and manipulate the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/196aa076114048ecaa33bbb2d6acfd97.poster.avif?t=1752500112\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/196aa076114048ecaa33bbb2d6acfd97.webm?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505800/extras/196aa076114048ecaa33bbb2d6acfd97.mp4?t=1752500112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Advanced Graphics &amp; Performance</strong> \u2013 Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine\u2019s latest technology</strong>, with <strong>Nvidia DLSS</strong> ensuring <strong>smooth, high-performance gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become <strong>the hunter</strong> or <strong>the hunted</strong>?</p>",
